WEBVTT

01:39.000 --> 01:40.670
<b>NO!</b>

02:00.000 --> 02:00.710
<b>Eiko!</b>

02:02.210 --> 02:03.170
<b>Yayoi-chan!</b>

02:04.920 --> 02:05.830
<b>Are you hurt?</b>

02:07.040 --> 02:08.920
<b>Thanks. I'm okay.</b>

02:09.420 --> 02:12.130
<b>We weakened the last "angel." Let's finish it off.</b>

02:12.290 --> 02:12.960
<b>Yeah!</b>

02:26.000 --> 02:28.130
<b>Stop that, it's too weak.</b>

02:30.630 --> 02:34.540
<b>Okay, Dad. Let it eat you, then.</b>

02:36.040 --> 02:40.290
<b>Whose fault is it that we're in this mess?</b>

02:42.330 --> 02:44.460
<b>Right. I know.</b>

02:46.040 --> 02:47.580
<b>That's my sweet, stupid father!</b>

02:58.080 --> 03:00.170
<b>Wh... why?</b>

03:01.130 --> 03:06.750
<b>I just wanted to be saved.</b>

03:09.040 --> 03:13.170
<b>Once my precious angel was born...
No one would bother us anymore...</b>

03:13.670 --> 03:19.630
<b>They said it would take us to Heaven...</b>

03:28.380 --> 03:29.580
<b>It's on the second floor!</b>

03:29.580 --> 03:30.290
<b>Let's go.</b>

03:47.920 --> 03:49.500
<b>The father is here.</b>

03:49.750 --> 03:50.540
<b>Huh?</b>

03:51.920 --> 03:53.420
<b>Please, end it.</b>

03:54.920 --> 03:58.920
<b>I knew this "ritual" wouldn't do anything.</b>

04:00.040 --> 04:04.380
<b>But I'm the one who put her in this situation.</b>

04:05.250 --> 04:09.170
<b>I thought the only way to make it up to her
was to do as she said.</b>

04:10.210 --> 04:14.040
<b>But I shouldn't have focused
on atoning for murdering my wife.</b>

04:14.540 --> 04:20.000
<b>I should have set my daughter on the right path.</b>

04:20.710 --> 04:21.750
<b>If I had...</b>

04:28.790 --> 04:31.630
<b>Then she wouldn't have...</b>

04:32.960 --> 04:35.670
<b>And I wouldn't have...</b>

04:38.960 --> 04:39.710
<b>Please.</b>

04:40.420 --> 04:44.210
<b>Let me die and be with my family.</b>

04:49.130 --> 04:52.580
<b>No... Not them, too...</b>

05:11.250 --> 05:13.670
<b>Lucky that we were standing in the right spot.</b>

05:16.670 --> 05:19.080
<b>It met the same end as its mother.</b>

05:24.630 --> 05:26.750
<b>Once it's all done, I'll put them to rest.</b>

05:27.130 --> 05:31.250
<b>Then, their souls can be born again.
The right way, this time.</b>

05:32.420 --> 05:36.920
<b>We finished off all three angels.
Eiko, how's your belly looking?</b>

05:40.460 --> 05:42.710
<b>The curse is still there...</b>

05:43.420 --> 05:45.710
<b>Something else is powering it, then.</b>

05:47.170 --> 05:51.670
<b>The real altar was already dismantled.
What I'm seeing is an illusion.</b>

05:51.790 --> 05:52.710
<b>Yayoi-chan.</b>

05:53.210 --> 05:55.920
<b>There's a spot on the wall that's different from the rest.</b>

06:02.630 --> 06:06.540
<b>The illusion hides that spot
from people who are gifted with the sight.</b>

06:07.710 --> 06:10.880
<b>And those who can't see the illusion
would just think it's a random patch job.</b>

06:15.210 --> 06:16.000
<b>A box!</b>

06:21.290 --> 06:22.380
<b>What is that?</b>

06:22.710 --> 06:25.420
<b>A bone, probably the mom's.</b>

06:26.080 --> 06:27.250
<b>I want to look into this later.</b>

06:27.580 --> 06:29.130
<b>Take a picture and a video of this.</b>

06:29.130 --> 06:30.130
<b>O-okay.</b>

06:36.580 --> 06:38.250
<b>Eiko, how's your belly now?</b>

06:43.790 --> 06:45.960
<b>It's... it's gone!</b>

06:48.750 --> 06:50.920
<b>Thank you!</b>

06:50.920 --> 06:51.920
<b>I'm glad you're okay.</b>

06:52.290 --> 06:52.920
<b>Same!</b>

06:53.500 --> 06:54.750
<b>Kill me.</b>

06:59.000 --> 06:59.790
<b>I'm begging you.</b>

07:01.710 --> 07:04.130
<b>Before I do, answer this question.</b>

07:05.580 --> 07:06.880
<b>How many people died?</b>

07:07.710 --> 07:09.750
<b>No. How many did you kill?</b>

07:13.630 --> 07:15.170
<b>I killed my wife.</b>

07:16.130 --> 07:18.000
<b>I didn't stop my daughter.</b>

07:19.040 --> 07:21.830
<b>I hurt so many innocent people.</b>

07:22.960 --> 07:27.290
<b>Then, in the end, I took my own life.</b>

07:29.000 --> 07:31.580
<b>Seven... Seventeen.</b>

07:32.960 --> 07:34.830
<b>I killed seventeen people.</b>

07:35.170 --> 07:37.830
<b>I'm not going to let you escape judgment by passing on.</b>

07:38.710 --> 07:43.670
<b>You'll remain here, in this place of spiritual power,
forced to face your sins...</b>

07:44.170 --> 07:46.080
<b>...as you resume your role as head of the household.</b>

07:48.380 --> 07:50.330
<b>Eiko, buy the house.</b>

07:57.420 --> 08:01.710
<b>Hello, it's me again. We'd like to buy it!</b>

08:01.710 --> 08:05.670
<b>Wait, for real?! Uh, okay,
let me put together the paperwork...</b>

08:05.670 --> 08:07.670
<b>Thanks! Then we'll see you soon.</b>

08:24.830 --> 08:28.960
<b>Seems like you got some of your memories back...
And some power, too.</b>

08:34.380 --> 08:35.830
<b>Okay, ready to go?</b>

08:44.330 --> 08:47.500
<b>What? Wh-why?!</b>

08:48.000 --> 08:52.750
<b>Facing his sins has forced him to remember
his most grief-stricken moment,</b>

08:52.750 --> 08:56.080
<b>which caused him to unconsciously relive his death.</b>

08:57.000 --> 09:01.380
<b>Creepy, but works great to keep people out.
We can count on him to watch the house.</b>

09:04.210 --> 09:07.420
<b>We got ourselves a house for our Graduates.</b>

09:13.330 --> 09:15.830
<b>Sup, Akari. Where's Keitaro?</b>

09:15.920 --> 09:17.170
<b>Out jogging.</b>

09:17.790 --> 09:19.670
<b>Whatcha watching? Pretty Cure?</b>

09:21.420 --> 09:23.380
<b>No! I'm too old for that!</b>

09:23.380 --> 09:25.210
<b>You know I don't care if you watch it.</b>

09:25.210 --> 09:26.750
<b>Yeah, I know, but I wasn't!</b>

09:26.750 --> 09:28.000
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

09:29.170 --> 09:32.040
<b>Breaking News: Shiga Train Derailment</b>

09:29.460 --> 09:31.830
<b>Let's go live to the scene now.</b>

09:32.210 --> 09:38.040
<b>This is B Area of Shiga Prefecture, where at 4:44 PM,
a high-speed train derailed and crashed.</b>

09:35.330 --> 09:45.210
<b>Breaking News: Shiga Train Derailment</b>

09:38.540 --> 09:41.000
<b>We are live in the air above the derailment now.</b>

09:41.880 --> 09:45.710
<b>No earthquakes were detected at the time
of the accident; the cause is still under investigation.</b>

09:46.250 --> 09:49.670
<b>Emergency personnel are still on scene
assisting the passengers,</b>

09:49.670 --> 09:52.790
<b>so we do not have any confirmed numbers
of casualties as of yet,</b>

09:53.130 --> 09:55.080
<b>but officials say there is a high likelihood of fatalities.</b>

09:59.040 --> 10:03.580
<b>Not half bad, for one who is but a fetus.</b>

10:15.710 --> 10:17.750
<b>Beware of calamity.</b>

10:18.580 --> 10:21.330
<b>You find yourself in an unlucky direction.</b>

10:45.710 --> 10:53.040
<b>It broke through my Da Liu Ren-divined
Compelled Calamity and destroyed one of my guardians.</b>

10:54.710 --> 10:56.130
<b>Well done, child.</b>

10:58.170 --> 10:59.710
<b>Come forth, Seeing Flesh.</b>

11:05.000 --> 11:07.580
<b>Eat. It will restore you.</b>

11:17.830 --> 11:19.210
<b>Listen well.</b>

11:19.750 --> 11:26.880
<b>You are weak because you use your incredible
telekinesis on a whim, instead of with purpose.</b>

11:28.830 --> 11:32.170
<b>Focus it, condense it to its limit.</b>

11:32.710 --> 11:37.960
<b>Make no wasteful movements,
merely envision what you wish to accomplish.</b>

11:38.210 --> 11:40.420
<b>That alone will be an improvement.</b>

11:45.960 --> 11:47.250
<b>Go, now.</b>

11:48.000 --> 11:50.170
<b>Do entertain me.</b>

12:02.830 --> 12:05.170
<b>I need that power.</b>

12:12.380 --> 12:16.250
<b>Jogging's been going well, so I think I'm back in shape...</b>

12:20.210 --> 12:23.540
<b>Kei-kun! We're here to check up on you!</b>

12:23.790 --> 12:24.830
<b>These are for you.</b>

12:25.290 --> 12:27.000
<b>Eiko! Yayoi-chan!</b>

12:27.960 --> 12:29.670
<b>How are you feeling? Better?</b>

12:29.670 --> 12:32.670
<b>Wha-? Can you not do that out here in public?!</b>

12:33.000 --> 12:34.790
<b>You haven't gotten better in the slightest.</b>

12:34.790 --> 12:36.920
<b>What?! I have, though!</b>

12:39.170 --> 12:40.540
<b>C'mon, don't hold back.</b>

12:41.290 --> 12:42.790
<b>You've got to eat!</b>

12:45.330 --> 12:46.920
<b>I'm stuffed! Literally!</b>

12:47.540 --> 12:51.250
<b>Please, this is hardly enough to fill a growing boy.</b>

12:51.250 --> 12:53.210
<b>There's plenty more for seconds!</b>

12:53.210 --> 12:55.580
<b>What am I, their starving grandson?!</b>

12:56.380 --> 13:00.710
<b>Oh, right, Kei-kun, we figured out
where to hide that talisman.</b>

13:01.000 --> 13:04.920
<b>Wait, you bought a piece of stigmatized property
to house the Graduates?!</b>

13:05.330 --> 13:07.960
<b>Yup. It's perfect 'cause no one lives nearby.</b>

13:08.380 --> 13:12.630
<b>Now, we can capture tons of Graduate-level ghosts
and shove 'em into the house.</b>

13:13.000 --> 13:15.460
<b>How do you come up with the craziest ideas?</b>

13:15.750 --> 13:16.830
<b>This was all Eiko.</b>

13:16.960 --> 13:17.630
<b>Yup!</b>

13:17.880 --> 13:18.830
<b>Seriously?</b>

13:19.580 --> 13:22.330
<b>Also, this has kinda been bugging me for a bit...</b>

13:22.750 --> 13:25.500
<b>But why're you guys doting on me this hard?!</b>

13:26.960 --> 13:29.500
<b>Don't let your guard down
just 'cause you're feeling better.</b>

13:29.500 --> 13:31.330
<b>Go to sleep. Right now.</b>

13:31.330 --> 13:35.630
<b>Get all the rest you can today,
so you can be back and at it tomorrow!</b>

13:35.790 --> 13:37.710
<b>We'll stay here till you fall asleep.</b>

13:37.920 --> 13:39.750
<b>Want me to sing you a lullaby?</b>

13:40.710 --> 13:42.710
<b>I'm gonna fall asleep too fast for that!</b>

13:42.710 --> 13:43.960
<b>Cool!</b>

13:44.880 --> 13:46.250
<b>10 SECONDS LATER</b>

13:46.630 --> 13:47.540
<b>You asleep yet?</b>

13:47.750 --> 13:48.630
<b>Not yet.</b>

13:49.380 --> 13:50.750
<b>10 SECONDS LATER</b>

13:51.130 --> 13:52.000
<b>You asleep yet?</b>

13:52.170 --> 13:53.040
<b>Not yet!</b>

13:53.710 --> 13:55.130
<b>10 SECONDS LATER</b>

13:55.130 --> 13:55.580
<b>You asleep ye-?</b>

13:55.580 --> 13:56.710
<b>Not like this!</b>

13:57.460 --> 13:59.210
<b>KICKED OUT</b>

13:59.210 --> 14:00.330
<b>That solves that!</b>

14:01.630 --> 14:04.580
<b>Keitaro should be back to normal by tomorrow.</b>

14:04.750 --> 14:07.880
<b>Then all three of us can go to our next haunted location!</b>

14:08.330 --> 14:10.500
<b>I knew that's what they were after!</b>

14:11.540 --> 14:12.830
<b>How'm I supposed to sleep now?</b>

14:14.580 --> 14:17.630
<b>So, what's our next location?</b>

14:18.630 --> 14:23.500
<b>First, I want to stop by the K Area
to pick up our third Graduate.</b>

14:25.250 --> 14:26.880
<b>What's this one like?</b>

14:27.790 --> 14:28.420
<b>Well...</b>

14:29.210 --> 14:30.960
<b>...she's an evil-hearted courtesan.</b>

14:31.460 --> 14:34.290
<b>A woman of unmatched beauty
who has attended to countless souls...</b>

14:34.880 --> 14:36.460
<b>...and brought them torment and anguish.</b>

14:38.540 --> 14:42.500
<b>But do not for a second
think she will be as cooperative as the martyr.</b>

14:45.130 --> 14:49.830
<b>Once we grab her, we'll head to the next closest haunt.</b>

14:50.250 --> 14:52.460
<b>It's dangerous enough to earn an S-Rank.</b>

14:57.460 --> 14:58.830
<b>The Old I Watergate.</b>

15:00.670 --> 15:01.920
<b>S-Rank...</b>

15:04.670 --> 15:05.500
<b>Scared?</b>

15:07.830 --> 15:09.290
<b>Yeah. I'm really scared.</b>

15:09.880 --> 15:12.500
<b>I thought I was going to die at the F Tunnel,</b>

15:12.830 --> 15:16.750
<b>and what happened at the house
was pretty traumatizing, too.</b>

15:17.920 --> 15:22.500
<b>I try to push it out of my mind, but can't shake it.</b>

15:22.920 --> 15:25.000
<b>But despite all that...</b>

15:25.580 --> 15:27.790
<b>When I think of that stabbing fear, that stinging pain...</b>

15:28.830 --> 15:34.420
<b>I know I shouldn't, but I can't help
but want to feel it one more time.</b>

15:35.500 --> 15:39.290
<b>I'm getting more and more addicted to that fear!</b>

15:41.170 --> 15:44.540
<b>I can barely contain my excitement!</b>

15:45.580 --> 15:48.290
<b>Then let's feed your addiction on the regular, together.</b>

15:49.580 --> 15:52.080
<b>See, this is why you're my favorite cousin!</b>

15:52.540 --> 15:53.250
<b>Sweet.</b>

15:53.960 --> 15:55.210
<b>Wait, hold on...</b>

15:55.580 --> 16:00.630
<b>With all this talk of Graduates and S-Rank haunts,
something's been on my mind.</b>

16:01.630 --> 16:04.920
<b>We're taking the Graduates with us this time,</b>

16:05.330 --> 16:08.630
<b>but when you tangled with Kishimojin before,
you just went by yourself.</b>

16:09.000 --> 16:14.380
<b>You said you need at least three Graduates
to take out a god.</b>

16:14.790 --> 16:17.040
<b>Why didn't you take one back then?</b>

16:17.580 --> 16:21.630
<b>Some spirits are bound by rules or concepts.</b>

16:22.170 --> 16:24.500
<b>Kishimojin is one of them.</b>

16:24.500 --> 16:25.540
<b>So what binds her?</b>

16:30.380 --> 16:34.380
<b>We now look ahead in time,
several days after this conversation...</b>

16:35.080 --> 16:38.710
<b>...to when the Spectre of Death
visits Kishimojin once more.</b>

16:39.670 --> 16:43.880
<b>It, too, has come to the same deduction
about the goddess' bindings,</b>

16:44.170 --> 16:48.670
<b>and will soon execute a plan
taking advantage of her weakness.</b>

17:00.460 --> 17:09.630
<b>In their last encounter, the Spectre believed the powerful
Kishimojin would deem it a threat to her children,</b>

17:09.790 --> 17:14.670
<b>and the goddess would smite it upon sight.</b>

17:15.420 --> 17:19.630
<b>So powerful was this belief that the Spectre
may not have ignored Kishimojin,</b>

17:19.880 --> 17:22.250
<b>but thought it was outright impossible to attack her.</b>

17:22.630 --> 17:27.710
<b>Now, however, it risks everything to test its theory.</b>

17:28.460 --> 17:33.750
<b>It taunts the wrath of Kishimojin
by preying upon her unborn.</b>

17:34.750 --> 17:39.210
<b>While doing so, it attempts to validate
the words spoken by the god within Ai,</b>

17:39.580 --> 17:44.920
<b>condensing its amorphous
telekinetic power and giving it form...</b>

17:45.750 --> 17:48.920
<b>...and sees immediate results.</b>

17:51.170 --> 17:55.000
<b>A sudden and dramatic improvement
to its ability to absorb power.</b>

18:04.210 --> 18:06.960
<b>Kishimojin is bound by one simple rule.</b>

18:09.250 --> 18:10.420
<b>Mommy?</b>

18:14.380 --> 18:18.000
<b>Kishimojin... cannot harm children.</b>

18:20.040 --> 18:25.920
<b>So I knew I didn't have to waste time
getting a Graduate. I'd be fine on my own.</b>

18:27.960 --> 18:30.250
<b>Wait, but I thought you got hurt.</b>

18:30.710 --> 18:32.920
<b>That wasn't the goddess?</b>

18:32.920 --> 18:37.290
<b>Nope. It was one of her unborn spirits.</b>

18:38.170 --> 18:45.580
<b>Yes, she'd been poisoned by ill intent, but I think she still
tried to protect me from the unborn by keeping me close.</b>

18:46.290 --> 18:50.710
<b>I chose to go after her alone because I knew I'd be fine.</b>

18:51.330 --> 18:57.000
<b>If a grown-up tried to capture her,
they'd need at least six Graduates.</b>

18:57.540 --> 18:58.880
<b>Not only that,</b>

18:59.630 --> 19:01.960
<b>but they'd have to deal
with all those unborn babies, too...</b>

19:03.580 --> 19:09.630
<b>This additional challenge Yayoi mentioned
was one the Spectre had already resolved.</b>

19:09.830 --> 19:15.500
<b>By consuming its enemy, it eliminates their threat
and strengthens itself all the while.</b>

19:15.880 --> 19:17.130
<b>Mommy?</b>

19:16.290 --> 19:17.130
<b>Then...</b>

19:20.500 --> 19:24.170
<b>As its strength grew, so, too,
did its ability to use its telekinesis.</b>

19:24.580 --> 19:27.960
<b>Now, it wields its power with yet-unseen prowess...</b>

19:30.330 --> 19:32.540
<b>...to make sport of the divine.</b>

20:01.170 --> 20:02.750
<b>Mommy...</b>

20:11.580 --> 20:14.080
<b>Stop... stop this.</b>

20:14.920 --> 20:17.330
<b>No. I can't...</b>

20:25.750 --> 20:28.540
<b>Mommy, give birth to me.</b>

20:55.460 --> 21:00.500
<b>The twilight before the dawn
is sometimes called "kawatare-doki."</b>

21:01.540 --> 21:09.290
<b>Literally translated, it means, "'Who is that?' Time." A time
when it is still too dark to discern an approaching figure.</b>

21:10.170 --> 21:14.330
<b>As the dawn breaks over the horizon,
the figure's identity is revealed.</b>

21:15.080 --> 21:17.380
<b>Who, then, is this spirit?</b>

21:26.330 --> 21:31.250
<b>It is, undeniably, the Spectre of Death.</b>

23:22.290 --> 23:30.920
<b>The team heads to an abandoned love hotel, where yet
another powerful Graduate has been hidden away.</b>

23:32.000 --> 23:39.540
<b>But when Keitaro heads inside,
he finds himself transported to a lost red-light district.</b>
